# Process overlay keywords

The chip cluster under Search guides (`ProcessFind` overlay) is a **keyword feed**, not Topics.

Pull labels from names that already exist in:

1. Renovation Requirements (RR / `process-rules-v6`)
2. Tenant–Contractor Kit (post-kickoff pack)
3. FAQ guides (when they land on the map)

Do not invent Project Officer jumps. Do not use chapter titles (`Access for the team`…) — those filter the desk.

A chip only shows if it already matches the current catalogue (this role + unit). Never surface CAG-internal systems to tenant/contractor.

At rest: up to 6, covering SetUp → Exit (not only the first five pack names). Typed overlay filters the same pool, cap 8. Short labels; wrap is fine.
